    "rich_text_XjaEM8": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_Ayy6fe": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Why RORRY is Your Best Wholesale Power Bank Supplier?",
            "heading_size": "title-md",
            "heading_tag": "h2",
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "text_XMq3wE": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<ul><li><h3>Aesthetic Leadership & Brand Alignment</h3></li></ul><p>Ditch the bulky, industrial-looking chargers. RORRY offers <strong>aesthetic portable chargers</strong> in pastel tones (Lavender, Rose Quartz, Cream) that align with modern lifestyle brands. Give a gift that your clients and employees will actually feel proud to carry and show off.</p><ul><li><h3>The Ultimate 3-in-1 Efficiency</h3></li></ul><p>Our <strong>wholesale power bank chargers</strong> are designed specifically for the Apple ecosystem. With built-in cables and dedicated Apple Watch wireless charging, your recipients won't need to carry extra wires—making it the most functional <strong>custom branded power bank</strong> they’ve ever received.</p><ul><li><h3>Safety Certified & Travel Ready</h3></li></ul><p>Quality is non-negotiable for bulk orders. All RORRY devices are <strong>airline-approved</strong> and come with global safety certifications (CE, FCC, RoHS). We provide a <strong>12-month worry-free protection</strong>, ensuring your corporate reputation is safe with our hardware.</p><ul><li><h3>Small Business Friendly (Low MOQ)</h3></li></ul><p>We empower brands of all sizes. While most <strong>portable power bank suppliers</strong> require thousands of units, RORRY supports your growth with a low <strong>Minimum Order Quantity (MOQ) starting from 100 units</strong> for custom logo printing.</p>",
            "text_font": "body",
            "text_size": "subtext-md",
            "text_max_size": 32,
            "text_line_height": 1.6,
            "text_letter_spacing": 0,
            "text_capitalize": false,
            "secondary_color": false,
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "heading_Ayy6fe",
        "text_XMq3wE"
      ],
