    "timeline_dMQJwD": {
      "type": "timeline",
      "blocks": {
        "content_cfbbWj": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "Step1",
            "heading": "Expert Consultation & Selection",
            "heading_tag": "h3",
            "text": "<p>Browse our collection and choose the model that best fits your event—be it the ultra-compact <a href=\"https://rorry.com/products/rorry-d2-5000mah-portable-charger-keychain-power-bank-white-logo-customization\" title=\"Custom RORRY D2-5000mAh Portable Charger\"><strong>D2 Keychain Series</strong></a> or the high-capacity <a href=\"https://rorry.com/products/rorry-palmgo-d5-10000mah-portable-charger-custom-logo\" title=\"Custom RORRY PalmGo D5-10000mAh power banks\"><strong>PalmGo D5</strong></a>. Our team provides personalized recommendations based on your budget and target audience.</p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "button_style": "primary",
            "button_external": false,
            "button_icon": true,
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "content_mDXbjk": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "Step2",
            "heading": "Logo Submission & Design Layout",
            "heading_tag": "h3",
            "text": "<p>Send us your brand logo in vector format ((SVG / AI / EPS / PDF / CDR). Our professional designers will create a visual mockup, strategically placing your <strong>custom logo</strong> on the device to ensure maximum brand visibility and aesthetic appeal.</p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "button_style": "primary",
            "button_external": false,
            "button_icon": true,
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "content_hPttqK": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "Step3",
            "heading": "Free Digital Proof & Approval",
            "heading_tag": "h3",
            "text": "<p>Within <strong>24 hours</strong>, you will receive a digital design proof. We offer unlimited revisions until you are 100% satisfied. If required, we can also discuss custom packaging options to make your <strong>bulk power bank purchase</strong> gift-ready.</p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "button_style": "primary",
            "button_external": false,
            "button_icon": true,
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "content_iBTcAA": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "Step4",
            "heading": "Precision Production & Global Express",
            "heading_tag": "h3",
            "text": "<p>Once approved, we move to high-precision printing. Our bulk production typically takes <strong>3-7 business days</strong>. We then utilize <strong>Global Air Express shipping</strong>, ensuring your branded chargers arrive at your office or event venue within 7-12 days, fully tracked.</p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "button_style": "primary",
            "button_external": false,
            "button_icon": true,
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "content_cfbbWj",
